# Infrastructure Perspective

Without containers:

```text
Jenkins Master (VM)
        |
        +-- Jenkins Slave Node 1 (VM) --> Java Builds
        +-- Jenkins Slave Node 2 (VM) --> .NET Builds
        +-- Jenkins Slave Node 3 (VM) --> Python Builds
        +-- Jenkins Slave Node 4 (VM) --> Angular/NodeJS Builds
        +-- Jenkins Slave Node 5 (VM) --> Ruby Builds
```

Using containers:

```text
Jenkins Master (VM)
        |
        +-- Jenkins Slave Node 1 (VM)
                |
                +-- Container C1 --> Java Builds
                +-- Container C2 --> .NET Builds
                +-- Container C3 --> Python Builds
                +-- Container C4 --> Angular/NodeJS Builds
                +-- Container C5 --> Ruby Builds
```

